<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol H1 net profit down 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol H1 net profit down 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Repsol group first half results for six months to end June in billions of pesetas, unless otherwise stated:</p>
<p>					 H1 1996	     H1 1995</p>
<p> Net attributable profit	   61.45	vs     62.16</p>
<p> Revenue			    1,296.42	vs  1,305.22</p>
<p> Operating margin		    96.05	vs    111.38</p>
</text>
